              "text": "See Dr. Okafor, your heart doctor. Go in 1 week. This visit checks your heart.",
              "sources": [
                "p1:L23"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "a8",
              "text": "Get a blood test for salts and kidneys. Go in 3 days. This test checks your potassium and kidney function.",
